        "### Apa yang dilakukan kode ini\n",
        "\n",
        "Class `PoissonQueueHourModel` bisa dipakai ulang untuk kasus lain. Misalnya:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "model2 = PoissonQueueHourModel(\n",
        "    arrival_rate_per_hour=60,\n",
        "    service_rate_per_hour=55,\n",
        "    waiting_capacity=15\n",
        ")\n",
        "print(model2.summary())\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### Interpretasi model\n",
        "\n",
        "Dalam 1 jam:\n",
        "\n",
        "* `arrivals ~ Poisson(50)`\n",
        "* `services ~ Poisson(50)`\n",
        "\n",
        "Lalu:\n",
        "\n",
        "* **antrian terjadi** bila `arrivals > services`\n",
        "* **luber** bila `arrivals - services > 10`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Kelebihan desain class ini\n",
        "\n",
        "* parameter mudah diubah\n",
        "* ada metode **eksak**\n",
        "* ada **simulasi**\n",
        "* ada **plot**\n",
        "* cocok dikembangkan ke model yang lebih realistis\n",
        "\n",
        "### Catatan penting\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini masih model **sederhana per jam**, belum model antrian kontinu menit demi menit. Untuk model yang lebih realistis, tahap berikutnya adalah membuat class **M/M/c** dengan:\n",
        "\n",
        "* arrival Poisson\n",
        "* service time exponential\n",
        "* jumlah loket `c`\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## penjelasan\n",
        "Dengan data yang diberikan, cara paling sederhana adalah memodelkan **selisih antara jumlah datang dan jumlah yang bisa dilayani selama 1 jam**.\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1) Ubah ke laju per jam\n",
        "\n",
        "Jam kerja 8–16 = **8 jam**.\n",
        "\n",
        "* Rata-rata **kedatangan** per hari = 400 orang\n",
        "  ⇒ rata-rata per jam = (400/8 = 50)\n",
        "\n",
        "* Rata-rata **pelayanan** per hari = 400 orang\n",
        "  ⇒ rata-rata per jam = (400/8 = 50)\n",
        "\n",
        "Jadi untuk jam **08.00–09.00** kita ambil:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "A \\sim \\text{Poisson}(50), \\qquad S \\sim \\text{Poisson}(50)\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "dengan:\n",
        "\n",
        "* (A) = jumlah orang datang dalam 1 jam\n",
        "* (S) = jumlah orang yang selesai dilayani dalam 1 jam\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2) Kapan terjadi antrian?\n",
        "\n",
        "Dalam pendekatan sederhana ini, **antrian muncul** bila dalam jam itu jumlah datang **lebih banyak** daripada jumlah yang dapat dilayani:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "A > S\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Karena rata-ratanya sama, distribusi selisih (D=A-S) simetris di sekitar 0.\n",
        "\n",
        "Maka:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "P(A>S)=\\frac{1-P(A=S)}{2}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk (\\lambda_A=\\lambda_S=50), hasilnya:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "P(A=S)\\approx 0.03994\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "sehingga:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "P(A>S)\\approx \\frac{1-0.03994}{2} \\approx 0.4800\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "### Jadi peluang terjadi antrian pada jam 08–09 kira-kira:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\boxed{0.48 \\text{ atau } 48%}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3) Kapan ruang tunggu 10 kursi luber?\n",
        "\n",
        "Ruang tunggu luber bila yang tidak tertangani melebihi 10 orang, yaitu:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "A-S>10\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Hasilnya:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "P(A-S>10)\\approx 0.1466\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "### Jadi peluang luber pada jam 08–09 kira-kira:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\boxed{0.1466 \\text{ atau } 14.7%}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4) Intuisi\n",
        "\n",
        "Walaupun **rata-rata datang = rata-rata pelayanan = 50 per jam**, karena keduanya acak:\n",
        "\n",
        "* kadang datang 43, dilayani 55 → tidak ada antrian\n",
        "* kadang datang 58, dilayani 47 → ada antrian 11 orang\n",
        "* kadang datang 50, dilayani 50 → seimbang\n",
        "\n",
        "Jadi **rata-rata sama tidak berarti antrian hilang**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 5) Catatan penting\n",
        "\n",
        "Hasil di atas memakai **penyederhanaan per jam**:\n",
        "\n",
        "* sistem dianggap mulai kosong pada pukul 08.00\n",
        "* antrian dilihat dari **selisih total datang dan total pelayanan dalam 1 jam**\n",
        "* belum memodelkan detail banyak loket, lama pelayanan per orang, dan dinamika menit demi menit\n",
        "\n",
        "Kalau ingin model antrian yang lebih realistis, biasanya dipakai **M/M/c**:\n",
        "\n",
        "* arrival Poisson\n",
        "* service time eksponensial\n",
        "* (c) loket\n",
        "\n",
        "Di sana kita bisa hitung:\n",
        "\n",
        "* peluang semua loket sibuk\n",
        "* rata-rata panjang antrian\n",
        "* peluang ruang tunggu penuh\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk itu saya perlu tahu **berapa jumlah loket** dan **rata-rata waktu pelayanan per orang**.\n",
        "\n",
        "# MMC\n",
        "\n",
        "Berikut versi **M/M/c** yang **reusable dengan class**, dengan asumsi:\n",
        "\n",
        "* kedatangan mengikuti **Poisson** dengan laju `λ`\n",
        "* waktu pelayanan tiap loket mengikuti **Eksponensial** dengan laju `μ`\n",
        "* jumlah loket aktif **tidak tetap**, tetapi acak:\n",
        "  $$\n",
        "  C \\sim \\text{Binomial}(n, p)\n",
        "  $$\n",
        "  artinya dari `n` loket maksimum, tiap loket aktif dengan peluang `p`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini cocok untuk situasi seperti:\n",
        "\n",
        "* ada `n` loket terpasang,\n",
        "* tapi tidak semua petugas selalu hadir / aktif,\n",
        "* sehingga jumlah loket yang benar-benar melayani berubah-ubah.\n",
        "\n",
        "Kode di bawah memberi:\n",
        "\n",
        "* metrik analitik berbasis **conditioning pada c**\n",
        "* simulasi **discrete-event** per jam\n",
        "* visualisasi:\n",
        "\n",
        "  * distribusi jumlah loket aktif\n",
        "  * peluang antrian terhadap jumlah loket aktif\n",
        "  * histogram panjang antrian akhir\n",
        "  * kurva risiko overflow vs kapasitas kursi\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Python code\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "import math\n",
        "import heapq\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "from scipy.stats import binom\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "class MMcBinomialServers:\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    M/M/c dengan jumlah loket aktif C ~ Binomial(n_servers_max, p_active).\n",
        "\n",
        "    Asumsi:\n",
        "    - Arrival process: Poisson dengan rate lambda_per_hour\n",
        "    - Service time per server: Exponential dengan rate mu_per_server_per_hour\n",
        "    - Jumlah server aktif untuk setiap interval/simulasi diambil dari Binomial(n, p)\n",
        "\n",
        "    Fitur:\n",
        "    - Analitik steady-state dengan conditioning pada c\n",
        "    - Simulasi discrete-event selama satu horizon waktu (mis. 1 jam)\n",
        "    - Visualisasi reusable\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    def __init__(\n",
        "        self,\n",
        "        lambda_per_hour,\n",
        "        mu_per_server_per_hour,\n",
        "        n_servers_max,\n",
        "        p_active,\n",
        "        waiting_capacity=10,\n",
        "    ):\n",
        "        self.lam = float(lambda_per_hour)\n",
        "        self.mu = float(mu_per_server_per_hour)\n",
        "        self.n = int(n_servers_max)\n",
        "        self.p = float(p_active)\n",
        "        self.waiting_capacity = int(waiting_capacity)\n",
        "\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    # Bagian 1: Distribusi jumlah loket aktif\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    def server_pmf(self):\n",
        "        c_vals = np.arange(0, self.n + 1)\n",
        "        probs = binom.pmf(c_vals, self.n, self.p)\n",
        "        return c_vals, probs\n",
        "\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    # Bagian 2: Rumus M/M/c klasik\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    def _p0_mmc(self, c):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Probabilitas sistem kosong untuk M/M/c steady-state.\n",
        "        Berlaku bila rho = lam / (c*mu) < 1.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        if c <= 0:\n",
        "            return None\n",
        "        a = self.lam / self.mu\n",
        "        rho = self.lam / (c * self.mu)\n",
        "        if rho >= 1:\n",
        "            return None\n",
        "\n",
        "        s = sum((a ** k) / math.factorial(k) for k in range(c))\n",
        "        s += ((a ** c) / math.factorial(c)) * (1 / (1 - rho))\n",
        "        return 1 / s\n",
        "\n",
        "    def erlang_c_prob_wait_given_c(self, c):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        P(wait | c) untuk M/M/c steady-state.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        if c <= 0:\n",
        "            return 1.0 if self.lam > 0 else 0.0\n",
        "\n",
        "        rho = self.lam / (c * self.mu)\n",
        "        if rho >= 1:\n",
        "            return 1.0\n",
        "\n",
        "        p0 = self._p0_mmc(c)\n",
        "        a = self.lam / self.mu\n",
        "        pw = ((a ** c) / math.factorial(c)) * (1 / (1 - rho)) * p0\n",
        "        return pw\n",
        "\n",
        "    def lq_given_c(self, c):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Expected queue length Lq | c.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        if c <= 0:\n",
        "            return math.inf if self.lam > 0 else 0.0\n",
        "\n",
        "        rho = self.lam / (c * self.mu)\n",
        "        if rho >= 1:\n",
        "            return math.inf\n",
        "\n",
        "        pw = self.erlang_c_prob_wait_given_c(c)\n",
        "        return pw * rho / (1 - rho)\n",
        "\n",
        "    def wq_given_c(self, c):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Expected waiting time Wq | c.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        lq = self.lq_given_c(c)\n",
        "        if math.isinf(lq):\n",
        "            return math.inf\n",
        "        return lq / self.lam if self.lam > 0 else 0.0\n",
        "\n",
        "    def summary_by_c(self):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Ringkasan metrik untuk setiap kemungkinan c.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        rows = []\n",
        "        c_vals, probs = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        for c, pc in zip(c_vals, probs):\n",
        "            if c == 0:\n",
        "                util = math.inf if self.lam > 0 else 0.0\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                util = self.lam / (c * self.mu)\n",
        "\n",
        "            rows.append({\n",
        "                \"c\": int(c),\n",
        "                \"P(C=c)\": float(pc),\n",
        "                \"utilization_rho\": util,\n",
        "                \"P_wait_given_c\": self.erlang_c_prob_wait_given_c(int(c)),\n",
        "                \"Lq_given_c\": self.lq_given_c(int(c)),\n",
        "                \"Wq_hours_given_c\": self.wq_given_c(int(c)),\n",
        "            })\n",
        "        return rows\n",
        "\n",
        "    def unconditional_prob_wait(self):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        P(wait) = E[ P(wait | C) ]\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        c_vals, probs = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        return float(sum(\n",
        "            pc * self.erlang_c_prob_wait_given_c(int(c))\n",
        "            for c, pc in zip(c_vals, probs)\n",
        "        ))\n",
        "\n",
        "    def unconditional_expected_lq(self):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        E[Lq], bisa tak hingga jika ada peluang state tidak stabil.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        c_vals, probs = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        vals = []\n",
        "        for c, pc in zip(c_vals, probs):\n",
        "            lq = self.lq_given_c(int(c))\n",
        "            if math.isinf(lq) and pc > 0:\n",
        "                return math.inf\n",
        "            vals.append(pc * lq)\n",
        "        return float(sum(vals))\n",
        "\n",
        "    def unconditional_expected_wq(self):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        E[Wq], bisa tak hingga jika ada peluang state tidak stabil.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        c_vals, probs = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        vals = []\n",
        "        for c, pc in zip(c_vals, probs):\n",
        "            wq = self.wq_given_c(int(c))\n",
        "            if math.isinf(wq) and pc > 0:\n",
        "                return math.inf\n",
        "            vals.append(pc * wq)\n",
        "        return float(sum(vals))\n",
        "\n",
        "    def analytical_summary(self):\n",
        "        return {\n",
        "            \"lambda_per_hour\": self.lam,\n",
        "            \"mu_per_server_per_hour\": self.mu,\n",
        "            \"n_servers_max\": self.n,\n",
        "            \"p_active\": self.p,\n",
        "            \"expected_active_servers\": self.n * self.p,\n",
        "            \"P_wait_unconditional\": self.unconditional_prob_wait(),\n",
        "            \"E_Lq_unconditional\": self.unconditional_expected_lq(),\n",
        "            \"E_Wq_hours_unconditional\": self.unconditional_expected_wq(),\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    # Bagian 3: Simulasi discrete-event\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    def _simulate_one_run(self, horizon_hours=1.0, rng=None):\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        Simulasi satu horizon waktu.\n",
        "        Mengembalikan statistik run.\n",
        "        \"\"\"\n",
        "        if rng is None:\n",
        "            rng = np.random.default_rng()\n",
        "\n",
        "        c = rng.binomial(self.n, self.p)\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Generate arrival times selama horizon\n",
        "        arrival_times = []\n",
        "        t = 0.0\n",
        "        while True:\n",
        "            if self.lam <= 0:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "            t += rng.exponential(1 / self.lam)\n",
        "            if t > horizon_hours:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "            arrival_times.append(t)\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Min-heap waktu selesai pelayanan\n",
        "        service_heap = []\n",
        "\n",
        "        num_arrivals = 0\n",
        "        num_waited = 0\n",
        "        max_queue_len = 0\n",
        "        overflow_happened = False\n",
        "        queue_len_trace = []\n",
        "\n",
        "        for t_arr in arrival_times:\n",
        "            num_arrivals += 1\n",
        "\n",
        "            # Bersihkan semua layanan yang sudah selesai sebelum arrival ini\n",
        "            while service_heap and service_heap[0] <= t_arr:\n",
        "                heapq.heappop(service_heap)\n",
        "\n",
        "            in_service = len(service_heap)\n",
        "            queue_len = max(0, in_service - c) if c > 0 else 0\n",
        "            # Untuk implementasi yang benar, jumlah dalam heap = sedang dilayani + yang sudah dijadwalkan dari antrian.\n",
        "            # Maka queue sebenarnya adalah total dalam sistem selain yang sedang dilayani.\n",
        "            queue_len = max(0, len(service_heap) - c)\n",
        "\n",
        "            if c == 0:\n",
        "                # semua harus menunggu\n",
        "                num_waited += 1\n",
        "                queue_len += 1\n",
        "                # pelanggan akan mulai dilayani setelah server tersedia? Dalam horizon ini server nol terus.\n",
        "                # Untuk simulasi satu jam, kita anggap dia tetap di antrean.\n",
        "                service_completion = float(\"inf\")\n",
        "                heapq.heappush(service_heap, service_completion)\n",
        "            elif len(service_heap) < c:\n",
        "                # langsung dilayani\n",
        "                service_time = rng.exponential(1 / self.mu)\n",
        "                finish_time = t_arr + service_time\n",
        "                heapq.heappush(service_heap, finish_time)\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                # harus menunggu sampai server tercepat selesai\n",
        "                num_waited += 1\n",
        "                earliest_finish = heapq.heappop(service_heap)\n",
        "                start_service = earliest_finish\n",
        "                service_time = rng.exponential(1 / self.mu)\n",
        "                new_finish = start_service + service_time\n",
        "                heapq.heappush(service_heap, new_finish)\n",
        "\n",
        "                # Queue length saat sesaat setelah kedatangan\n",
        "                queue_len = max(0, len(service_heap) - c)\n",
        "\n",
        "            max_queue_len = max(max_queue_len, queue_len)\n",
        "            if queue_len > self.waiting_capacity:\n",
        "                overflow_happened = True\n",
        "\n",
        "            queue_len_trace.append(queue_len)\n",
        "\n",
        "        end_queue_len = 0 if c == 0 and len(service_heap) == 0 else max(0, len(service_heap) - c)\n",
        "\n",
        "        return {\n",
        "            \"active_servers\": c,\n",
        "            \"num_arrivals\": num_arrivals,\n",
        "            \"num_waited\": num_waited,\n",
        "            \"prob_wait_empirical_run\": (num_waited / num_arrivals) if num_arrivals > 0 else 0.0,\n",
        "            \"max_queue_len\": max_queue_len,\n",
        "            \"overflow_happened\": overflow_happened,\n",
        "            \"end_queue_len\": end_queue_len,\n",
        "            \"queue_len_trace\": queue_len_trace,\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "    def simulate(self, n_sim=5000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=123):\n",
        "        rng = np.random.default_rng(random_seed)\n",
        "        runs = [self._simulate_one_run(horizon_hours=horizon_hours, rng=rng) for _ in range(n_sim)]\n",
        "\n",
        "        active_servers = np.array([r[\"active_servers\"] for r in runs])\n",
        "        num_arrivals = np.array([r[\"num_arrivals\"] for r in runs])\n",
        "        max_queue_len = np.array([r[\"max_queue_len\"] for r in runs])\n",
        "        end_queue_len = np.array([r[\"end_queue_len\"] for r in runs])\n",
        "        overflow = np.array([r[\"overflow_happened\"] for r in runs], dtype=float)\n",
        "        waited = np.array([r[\"prob_wait_empirical_run\"] for r in runs])\n",
        "\n",
        "        return {\n",
        "            \"runs\": runs,\n",
        "            \"avg_active_servers\": active_servers.mean(),\n",
        "            \"avg_num_arrivals\": num_arrivals.mean(),\n",
        "            \"avg_prob_wait_per_run\": waited.mean(),\n",
        "            \"prob_overflow\": overflow.mean(),\n",
        "            \"avg_max_queue_len\": max_queue_len.mean(),\n",
        "            \"avg_end_queue_len\": end_queue_len.mean(),\n",
        "            \"active_servers_samples\": active_servers,\n",
        "            \"max_queue_len_samples\": max_queue_len,\n",
        "            \"end_queue_len_samples\": end_queue_len,\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    # Bagian 4: Visualisasi\n",
        "    # =========================\n",
        "    def plot_server_distribution(self):\n",
        "        c_vals, probs = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        plt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
        "        plt.bar(c_vals, probs)\n",
        "        plt.title(\"Distribusi Jumlah Loket Aktif\")\n",
        "        plt.xlabel(\"Jumlah loket aktif (c)\")\n",
        "        plt.ylabel(\"Probabilitas\")\n",
        "        plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "        plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "    def plot_prob_wait_by_c(self):\n",
        "        c_vals, _ = self.server_pmf()\n",
        "        pw = [self.erlang_c_prob_wait_given_c(int(c)) for c in c_vals]\n",
        "\n",
        "        plt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
        "        plt.plot(c_vals, pw, marker=\"o\")\n",
        "        plt.title(\"Peluang Harus Menunggu vs Jumlah Loket Aktif\")\n",
        "        plt.xlabel(\"Jumlah loket aktif (c)\")\n",
        "        plt.ylabel(\"P(wait | c)\")\n",
        "        plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "        plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "    def plot_simulated_end_queue_hist(self, n_sim=5000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=123):\n",
        "        sim = self.simulate(n_sim=n_sim, horizon_hours=horizon_hours, random_seed=random_seed)\n",
        "        data = sim[\"end_queue_len_samples\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "        bins = np.arange(data.min() - 0.5, data.max() + 1.5, 1)\n",
        "        plt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
        "        plt.hist(data, bins=bins, density=True, edgecolor=\"black\")\n",
        "        plt.axvline(self.waiting_capacity + 0.5, linestyle=\"--\", label=\"Batas kursi tunggu\")\n",
        "        plt.title(\"Histogram Panjang Antrean di Akhir Horizon\")\n",
        "        plt.xlabel(\"Jumlah dalam antrean\")\n",
        "        plt.ylabel(\"Frekuensi relatif\")\n",
        "        plt.legend()\n",
        "        plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "        plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "    def plot_overflow_vs_capacity(self, max_capacity=20, n_sim=3000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=123):\n",
        "        caps = np.arange(0, max_capacity + 1)\n",
        "        probs = []\n",
        "        old_cap = self.waiting_capacity\n",
        "\n",
        "        for cap in caps:\n",
        "            self.waiting_capacity = int(cap)\n",
        "            sim = self.simulate(n_sim=n_sim, horizon_hours=horizon_hours, random_seed=random_seed)\n",
        "            probs.append(sim[\"prob_overflow\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.waiting_capacity = old_cap\n",
        "\n",
        "        plt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
        "        plt.plot(caps, probs, marker=\"o\")\n",
        "        plt.title(\"Peluang Overflow vs Kapasitas Kursi Tunggu\")\n",
        "        plt.xlabel(\"Kapasitas kursi tunggu\")\n",
        "        plt.ylabel(\"P(overflow dalam horizon)\")\n",
        "        plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "        plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# =========================\n",
        "# DEMO\n",
        "# =========================\n",
        "if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n",
        "    # Contoh:\n",
        "    # rata-rata kedatangan 50 orang/jam\n",
        "    # tiap loket rata-rata melayani 12 orang/jam\n",
        "    # ada maksimum 6 loket\n",
        "    # tiap loket aktif dengan peluang 0.8\n",
        "    # kapasitas kursi tunggu 10\n",
        "    model = MMcBinomialServers(\n",
        "        lambda_per_hour=50,\n",
        "        mu_per_server_per_hour=12,\n",
        "        n_servers_max=6,\n",
        "        p_active=0.8,\n",
        "        waiting_capacity=10,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\"=== ANALYTICAL SUMMARY ===\")\n",
        "    summary = model.analytical_summary()\n",
        "    for k, v in summary.items():\n",
        "        print(f\"{k}: {v}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\"\\n=== SUMMARY BY c ===\")\n",
        "    for row in model.summary_by_c():\n",
        "        print(row)\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\"\\n=== SIMULATION SUMMARY ===\")\n",
        "    sim = model.simulate(n_sim=5000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=42)\n",
        "    for k, v in sim.items():\n",
        "        if k != \"runs\" and not isinstance(v, np.ndarray):\n",
        "            print(f\"{k}: {v}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    # plots\n",
        "    model.plot_server_distribution()\n",
        "    model.plot_prob_wait_by_c()\n",
        "    model.plot_simulated_end_queue_hist(n_sim=5000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=42)\n",
        "    model.plot_overflow_vs_capacity(max_capacity=20, n_sim=3000, horizon_hours=1.0, random_seed=42)\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Cara membaca model ini\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Jumlah loket aktif acak\n",
        "\n",
        "Kalau ada maksimum 6 loket dan tiap loket aktif dengan peluang 0.8, maka:\n",
        "\n",
        "[\n",
        "C \\sim \\text{Binomial}(6, 0.8)\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "Jadi bisa saja:\n",
        "\n",
        "* 4 loket aktif\n",
        "* 5 loket aktif\n",
        "* 6 loket aktif\n",
        "  dengan probabilitas masing-masing.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Conditional M/M/c\n",
        "\n",
        "Begitu `c` diketahui, sistem menjadi **M/M/c biasa**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk tiap `c`, kita bisa hitung:\n",
        "\n",
        "* (P(\\text{wait} \\mid c))\n",
        "* (L_q \\mid c)\n",
        "* (W_q \\mid c)\n",
        "\n",
        "Lalu dirata-ratakan terhadap distribusi Binomial jumlah loket aktif.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. Overflow\n",
        "\n",
        "Untuk **overflow ruang tunggu**, saya pakai **simulasi discrete-event**, karena:\n",
        "\n",
        "* jumlah loket aktif acak,\n",
        "* horizon waktu terbatas,\n",
        "* kapasitas tunggu terbatas,\n",
        "\n",
        "sehingga simulasi lebih mudah dipakai dan lebih fleksibel untuk demo kelas.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Contoh interpretasi parameter\n",
        "\n",
        "Misalnya:\n",
        "\n",
        "* `lambda_per_hour = 50`\n",
        "  rata-rata 50 orang datang per jam\n",
        "\n",
        "* `mu_per_server_per_hour = 12`\n",
        "  satu loket rata-rata melayani 12 orang per jam\n",
        "  berarti rata-rata 1 orang tiap 5 menit\n",
        "\n",
        "* `n_servers_max = 6`\n",
        "\n",
        "* `p_active = 0.8`\n",
        "  rata-rata loket aktif = (6 \\times 0.8 = 4.8)\n",
        "\n",
        "Karena kapasitas pelayanan rata-rata kira-kira:\n",
        "\n",
        "[\n",
        "4.8 \\times 12 = 57.6 \\text{ orang/jam}\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "maka sistem cenderung masih aman, tetapi bila loket aktif kebetulan hanya 3 atau 4, antrean bisa muncul.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Kalau ingin dipakai untuk kasus kantor catatan sipil tadi\n",
        "\n",
        "Anda bisa mulai dengan misalnya:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "model = MMcBinomialServers(\n",
        "    lambda_per_hour=50,      # 400/hari selama 8 jam\n",
        "    mu_per_server_per_hour=10,\n",
        "    n_servers_max=6,\n",
        "    p_active=0.9,\n",
        "    waiting_capacity=10,\n",
        ")\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Lalu ubah `mu`, `n`, dan `p` sesuai skenario:\n",
        "\n",
        "* petugas penuh\n",
        "* petugas kurang\n",
        "* beberapa loket sering kosong\n",
        "* jam sibuk vs jam sepi\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Catatan penting\n",
        "\n",
